<title>POLAND: PEKPOL OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>PEKPOL OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.10 vs   0.35</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.09 vs   0.40</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.02 vs   0.37 profit</p>
<p> Sales		   16.85 vs  15.07</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.19 vs   1.85</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.15 vs   2.52</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.66 vs   1.27</p>
<p> Sales		  164.69 vs 139.70</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish food producer is Pekpol SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
